#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.rst:2
msgid "mmedian"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:1
msgid "Compute the moving (sliding window) median of a tensor."
msgstr "テンソルの移動中央値（スライディングウィンドウ中央値）を計算します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:3
msgid ""
"This function calculates the median of elements within a sliding window "
"of size :attr:`span` along the specified dimension. The output tensor has"
" the same shape as the input tensor. For positions where the sliding "
"window cannot fully cover preceding elements (i.e., the first ``span - "
"1`` elements along the selected dimension), the result is ``nan``."
msgstr "この関数は、指定された次元に沿ってサイズ :attr:`span` のスライディングウィンドウ内の要素の中央値を計算します。出力テンソルの形状は入力テンソルと同じです。スライディングウィンドウが先行する要素を完全にカバーできない場合（すなわち、指定された次元に沿って最初の ``span - 1`` 要素の場合）、結果は ``nan`` となります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:10
msgid ""
"Letting :math:`s_0 \\le s_1 \\le \\dots \\le s_{\\text{span}-1}` denote "
"the sorted values of a window, the moving median is:"
msgstr ":math:`s_0 \\le s_1 \\le \\dots \\le s_{\\text{span}-1}` をウィンドウ内の値をソートしたものとすると、移動中央値は次のようになります:"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:13
msgid ""
"\\text{MMEDIAN}[i] =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"    s_{(\\text{span}-1)/2}\n"
"    & \\text{if } \\text{span} \\text{ is odd} \\\\\n"
"    \\left(s_{\\text{span}/2-1} + s_{\\text{span}/2}\\right) / 2\n"
"    & \\text{if } \\text{span} \\text{ is even}\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\text{MMEDIAN}[i] =\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"    s_{(\\text{span}-1)/2}\n"
"    & \\text{if } \\text{span} \\text{ is odd} \\\\\n"
"    \\left(s_{\\text{span}/2-1} + s_{\\text{span}/2}\\right) / 2\n"
"    & \\text{if } \\text{span} \\text{ is even}\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
"\n"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:22
msgid ""
"This is equivalent to ``QF.mquantile(x, span, 0.5, dim)`` and compatible "
"with ``pandas.DataFrame.rolling(span).median()``: for an even window "
"size, the two central values are averaged (linear interpolation)."
msgstr "これは ``QF.mquantile(x, span, 0.5, dim)`` と等価であり、``pandas.DataFrame.rolling(span).median()`` と互換性があります。ウィンドウサイズが偶数の場合、中央の 2 つの値が平均されます（線形補間）。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:28
msgid "The input tensor containing values. Must be a floating point tensor."
msgstr "値を含む入力テンソル。浮動小数点テンソルである必要があります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:32
msgid "The size of the sliding window. Must be positive."
msgstr "スライディングウィンドウのサイズ。正の値である必要があります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:35
msgid ""
"The dimension along which to compute the moving median. Default is -1 "
"(the last dimension)."
msgstr "移動中央値を計算する次元。デフォルトは -1（最後の次元）です。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:39
msgid ""
"A tensor of the same shape as the input, containing the moving median "
"values. The first ``span - 1`` elements along the specified dimension are"
" ``nan``."
msgstr "入力と同じ形状のテンソルで、移動中央値の値を含みます。指定された次元に沿った最初の ``span - 1`` 要素は ``nan`` になります。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.rst
msgid "Raises"
msgstr "例外"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:44
msgid "If ``span`` is not an integer (``bool`` is rejected)."
msgstr "``span`` が整数でない場合（``bool`` も拒否されます）。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:45
msgid "If ``span`` is not positive."
msgstr "``span`` が正でない場合。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:46
msgid "If ``x`` is not a floating point tensor."
msgstr "``x`` が浮動小数点テンソルでない場合。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:49
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:51
msgid ""
">>> # Moving median with an odd window size\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, 3.0, 2.0, 5.0, 4.0])\n"
">>> QF.mmedian(x, span=3)\n"
"tensor([nan, nan, 2., 3., 4.])"
msgstr ""
">>> # 奇数のウィンドウサイズでの移動中央値\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, 3.0, 2.0, 5.0, 4.0])\n"
">>> QF.mmedian(x, span=3)\n"
"tensor([nan, nan, 2., 3., 4.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:56
msgid ""
">>> # An even window size averages the two central values\n"
">>> QF.mmedian(x, span=2)\n"
"tensor([   nan, 2.0000, 2.5000, 3.5000, 4.5000])"
msgstr ""
">>> # 偶数のウィンドウサイズでは中央の 2 つの値が平均されます\n"
">>> QF.mmedian(x, span=2)\n"
"tensor([   nan, 2.0000, 2.5000, 3.5000, 4.5000])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:60
msgid ""
">>> # Moving median along the first dimension\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, 2.0],\n"
"...                   [5.0, 3.0],\n"
"...                   [3.0, 7.0]])\n"
">>> QF.mmedian(x, span=3, dim=0)\n"
"tensor([[nan, nan],\n"
"        [nan, nan],\n"
"        [3., 3.]])"
msgstr ""
">>> # 最初の次元に沿った移動中央値\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, 2.0],\n"
"...                   [5.0, 3.0],\n"
"...                   [3.0, 7.0]])\n"
">>> QF.mmedian(x, span=3, dim=0)\n"
"tensor([[nan, nan],\n"
"        [nan, nan],\n"
"        [3., 3.]])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:69
msgid ""
">>> # A window containing NaN yields NaN\n"
">>> QF.mmedian(torch.tensor([1.0, nan, 3.0, 4.0, 5.0]), span=2)\n"
"tensor([   nan,    nan,    nan, 3.5000, 4.5000])"
msgstr ""
">>> # NaN を含むウィンドウは NaN になります\n"
">>> QF.mmedian(torch.tensor([1.0, nan, 3.0, 4.0, 5.0]), span=2)\n"
"tensor([   nan,    nan,    nan, 3.5000, 4.5000])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:73
msgid ""
"If a window contains any NaN value, the moving median for that window is "
"NaN. Unlike ``pandas.DataFrame.rolling``, there is no "
"``min_periods``-style option to skip NaN values."
msgstr "ウィンドウ内に NaN 値が 1 つでも含まれる場合、そのウィンドウの移動中央値は NaN になります。``pandas.DataFrame.rolling`` とは異なり、NaN 値をスキップする ``min_periods`` のようなオプションはありません。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:78
msgid ""
"This function delegates to :func:`mquantile` with its automatic algorithm "
"selection: narrow windows use vectorized window operations, while larger-"
"window workloads use wavelet-matrix range selection."
msgstr "この関数は :func:`mquantile` の自動アルゴリズム選択に処理を委譲します。狭いウィンドウではベクトル化されたウィンドウ演算を、より大きなウィンドウのワークロードでは Wavelet Matrix による範囲選択を使用します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:83
msgid ":func:`mquantile`: The underlying moving quantile function."
msgstr ":func:`mquantile`: 基盤となる移動分位点関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:84
msgid ":func:`nanmedian`: Median over a whole dimension, skipping NaNs."
msgstr ":func:`nanmedian`: NaN をスキップして次元全体の中央値を計算する関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mmedian.mmedian:85
msgid ":func:`ma`: Moving average function."
msgstr ":func:`ma`: 移動平均関数。"
